# Textile Waste Intelligence Platform (TWIP)

An AI-powered platform for analyzing textile waste using **computer vision, material classification, recyclability assessment, and sustainability intelligence**. The system helps organizations identify textile materials, classify waste, evaluate recovery potential, and receive recycling or reuse recommendations.

## 🚀 Features

* 🔐 JWT Authentication & Role-Based Access
* 📦 Textile Waste & Inventory Management
* 🖼️ AI-based Textile Image Analysis
* 🧵 Fabric & Material Classification
* ♻️ Waste Classification & Recyclability Assessment
* 🔄 Recycling, Reuse & Upcycling Recommendations
* 🌱 Sustainability & Environmental Impact Analysis
* 📊 Role-based Dashboards & Analytics
* 🔔 Notifications & Alerts
* 📄 PDF & Excel Reports

## 👥 User Roles

* Recycling Facility Operator
* Sustainability Manager
* Textile Manufacturer
* Administrator

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

**Frontend:** React.js, JavaScript, Tailwind CSS
**Backend:** Python, FastAPI
**Database:** PostgreSQL
**AI/ML:** TensorFlow, EfficientNet, OpenCV, Scikit-learn
**Deployment:** Vercel
**Tools:** Git, GitHub, Postman

## 🔄 Workflow

```text
Upload Textile Image
        ↓
Image Analysis
        ↓
Material Classification
        ↓
Waste Classification
        ↓
Recyclability Assessment
        ↓
Sustainability Scoring
        ↓
Recycling / Reuse Recommendation
        ↓
Dashboard & Reports
```

## 📊 Circularity Scoring

The platform calculates an overall circularity score using:

* Material Recyclability — 35%
* Material Condition — 20%
* Reuse Potential — 20%
* Environmental Benefit — 15%
* Processing Feasibility — 10%

## 🎯 Goal

To reduce textile waste, improve material recovery, minimize landfill disposal, and support **sustainable and circular textile management**.

## 📌 Project

